  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un Pokémon Oiseau doué pour la plongée.\nIl nage sous l’eau à la recherche de\nsphaigne, son plat préféré.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "These bird Pokémon are excellent divers.\nThey swim around in the water eating\ntheir favorite food--peat moss.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quand on l’attaque, il s’ébroue et fait\njaillir de la vapeur d’eau de tout son\ncorps. Il se cache dedans pour s’enfuir.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When attacked, it uses its feathers\nto splash water, escaping under cover\nof the spray.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They are better at swimming than flying,\nand they happily eat their favorite food,\npeat moss, as they dive underwater.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/21/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They are better at swimming than flying,\nand they happily eat their favorite food,\npeat moss, as they dive underwater.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "てきに　おそわれると　ぜんしんの\nうもうから　みずしぶきを　だす。\nみずけむりに　まぎれて　にげるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "상대에게 공격당하면 전신의\n깃털에서 물보라를 내뿜는다.\n물안개에 숨어들어 도망친다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quand on l’attaque, il s’ébroue et fait jaillir de la\nvapeur d’eau de tout son corps. Il se cache dedans\npour s’enfuir.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Gerät es in Gefahr, versprüht es Wasser aus seinem\nFederkleid und nutzt den Sprühregen, um Reißaus\nzu nehmen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando se ve atacado, las plumas que lo recubren\ndespiden ráfagas de agua que lo ayudan a escapar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quando viene attaccato schizza acqua da tutte le\npiume del corpo. Fugge dileguandosi in una nuvola\ndi spruzzi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When attacked, it uses its feathers to splash water,\nescaping under cover of the spray.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "敵に　襲われると　全身の　羽毛から\n水しぶきを　出す。\n水煙に　紛れて　逃げるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando se ve atacado, las plumas que lo recubren\ndespiden ráfagas de agua que lo ayudan a escapar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "とぶよりも　およぐのが　とくいで\nすいちゅうに　もぐっては　だいすきな\nみずゴケを　うれしそうに　たべる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "나는 것보다 헤엄치는 것이 특기로\n수중에 잠수해서는 제일 좋아하는\n물이끼를 기쁘게 먹는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un Pokémon doué pour la plongée qui passe son\ntemps sous l’eau à chercher des sphaignes, son plat\npréféré.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es schwimmt besser, als es fliegen kann. Am liebsten\ntaucht es ins kühle Nass ab, um Torfmoos, seine\nLeibspeise, zu essen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nada a mayor velocidad de la que puede volar. Se\nsumerge en el agua para buscar musgo acuático, su\ncomida favorita.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È più ferrato nel nuoto che nel volo. Si immerge\nnell’acqua per mangiare i licheni marini di cui va matto.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They are better at swimming than flying, and they\nhappily eat their favorite food, peat moss, as they\ndive underwater.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
