      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "そらを　とぶのは　まだまだ　へた。おやの　スワンナの　おどりを　みてつばさの　うごかしかたを　まなぶ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "하늘을 나는 것은 아직 서툴다. 부모 스완나의 춤을 보고 날개를 움직이는 법을 터득한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "還不擅長在空中飛翔。會觀察親鳥舞天鵝的舞蹈來學習拍動翅膀的方式。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il ne sait pas encore très bien voler, alors il observe la danse de ses parents Lakmécygne pour apprendre à battre des ailes correctement.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Das Fliegen fällt diesem Pokémon noch schwer. Um die Flügelbewegungen zu üben, beobachtet es den Tanz von Swaroness, seinen Eltern.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aún no se le da muy bien volar. Observa con atención la danza de sus progenitores Swanna para aprender a mover las alas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Non è ancora bravo a volare. Osserva la danza degli Swanna suoi genitori per imparare a muovere le ali.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
